It reminds me that regardless of what it is, I must rely on the strength of the Lord. Be it dance, programming, raising support, or reaching people in his name. On my own I’m weak, but with God’s help, I can do all things.

I’ve seen only the first beggar on the streets since that night. He asks me for money for Tea every time I walk past, I offer to get him one, he always turns me down. So next time I go to dance class I’m going to take a thermos of hot water to make tea for him right there. And hopefully get a chance to share with him over a cup of tea. Pray for me that God will provide the words for me. Pray that he will be ready and willing to hear.

Proverbs 19:17
If you help the poor, you are lending to the Lord, And he will repay you!

